# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Shimmering Flats

step Mirage Raceway
  tip Follow the canyon east out of the mesas onto the salt flats. The goblins and gnomes of the Mirage Raceway are neutral and give quests to both factions.
  accept 1110                         -- Kravel Koalbeard
  accept 5762                         -- His crate is for Stranglethorn, later on the route
  accept 1104                         -- Fizzle Brassbolts

step Mirage Raceway: kill these as you meet them
  zone Thousand Needles
  tip Rocket Car Rubble lies all over the flats north of the raceway. Scorpid Reavers roam the north half; keep to it, away from the Saltstone Basilisks, Crystalhides and Gazers (32-35) west of the track, in the middle and the far south.
  collect 5794 quest 1104
  collect 5798 quest 1110

step Mirage Raceway
  turnin 1110                         -- Kravel Koalbeard
  turnin 1104                         -- Fizzle Brassbolts
